<title>GERMANY: VEW proposes 1996 dividend hike to 19 percent.</title>
<headline>VEW proposes 1996 dividend hike to 19 percent.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German energy group VEW AG said on Tuesday that it was proposing to raise its dividend to 19 percent from 18 percent for 1996.</p>
<p>In a compulsory statement, VEW said that it would report increased operating profits for 1996 after an overall improvement in the group's business.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
